  { q: 'Can ravens use tools?', a: 'Common Ravens do not use tools in the wild as reliably as New Caledonian Crows do. However, in experimental settings, ravens have used tools to access food, and wild ravens use objects manipulatively (rolling rocks, using sticks). They are capable of tool use but it is not their primary foraging strategy.' },
